WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.025
A snake encounter raises two questions: what might this snake be, and how can I explore nearby care?

00:00:07.025 --> 00:00:12.099
VenomLink brings on-device species suggestions and an interactive hospital map together for Lahore.

00:00:12.099 --> 00:00:15.611
This walkthrough uses actual screenshots from the working application.

00:00:16.411 --> 00:00:22.009
Choose a snake photograph and run the supplied Snake Teller classifier directly in your browser.

00:00:22.009 --> 00:00:26.488
The trained model was exported to ONNX and provides possible species matches.

00:00:26.488 --> 00:00:28.727
The separate foliage detector is excluded.

00:00:28.727 --> 00:00:33.952
A prediction is not a diagnosis or a determination of venom, safety, or treatment.

00:00:34.752 --> 00:00:41.042
The map starts with eleven independent facility records, including ten hospital candidates and one reference institution.

00:00:41.042 --> 00:00:44.580
Coordinates come from OpenStreetMap and public Punjab government sources.

00:00:44.580 --> 00:00:52.048
Python validates the dataset before it is stored in private Amazon S three and delivered through the application API.

00:00:52.848 --> 00:00:57.028
Select a starting point and compare seven user-listed hospital leads.

00:00:57.028 --> 00:01:01.625
Google traffic-aware driving estimates provide travel time, distance, and road geometry.

00:01:01.625 --> 00:01:04.550
The app highlights the quickest returned route.

00:01:04.550 --> 00:01:09.983
This captured test returned all seven routes, with Mayo Hospital at thirteen minutes.

00:01:09.983 --> 00:01:12.909
Results change with time and provider availability.

00:01:13.709 --> 00:01:18.862
Amazon Location searches nearby places and names through Lambda and API Gateway.

00:01:18.862 --> 00:01:28.738
Hospital-category coverage returned no matches in our Lahore tests, so the app also exposes the independent saved directory, clearly separated from AWS results.

00:01:28.738 --> 00:01:35.609
Ten injections per hospital is simulated demo inventory; real antivenom stock and treatment capability are unverified.

00:01:36.409 --> 00:01:41.895
The stack combines React and TypeScript, Google Maps, and ONNX Runtime Web.

00:01:41.895 --> 00:01:50.123
The deployed AWS services are S three, Lambda, API Gateway, Amazon Location, Secrets Manager, IAM, and CloudWatch logs.

00:01:50.123 --> 00:01:54.237
Iceberg and Athena remain optional scripts, not deployed services.

00:01:54.237 --> 00:01:59.266
Explore the live map and public code to reuse the pattern.

00:01:59.266 --> 00:02:02.009
Confirm actual care directly with hospitals.
